<title>ITALY: Milan bourse cash pre-opening prolonged to 0900gmt.</title>
<headline>Milan bourse cash pre-opening prolonged to 0900gmt.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The pre-opening phase on the Milan bourse cash stock market has been prolonged to 0900 GMT from its normal 0830 GMT limit because of technical problems, the Bourse Council said on Friday.</p>
<p>It was not yet known whether the market would begin trading as normal at 0900 GMT. Derivatives trading was unaffected.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
